press card-6
release
# A pointer drag within To Do: card-1 under card-4. A move of 3 pixels is
# under the threshold; the next one drags.
press card-1
move 100 83
move card-4 lower
release
# A pointer drag to another column, over the top half of its first card.
press card-2
move card-7 upper
release
# A pointer drag given up: over a card, then over nothing, then released.
press card-3
move card-5 upper
move off
release
# A pointer drag over an empty spot of Done, given up with Escape.
press card-4
move done
escape
